msgstr "Attendez le tir."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Wall bounce"
msgstr "Ouverture du mur"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost_peaceful.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watch enemy patterns"
msgstr "Regarder les modèles ennemis"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_blitz.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watch for armored aliens"
msgstr "Surveillez les aliens blindés"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_pacifist.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watch the river banks"
msgstr "Regardez les rives de la rivière"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis_sudden.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watch the serve rotation"
msgstr "Regardez la rotation du service"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost_blizzard.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watch the temperature"
msgstr "Regardez la température"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Weather cycles: Day → Snow → Fog → Night → Dawn (~3.5 min per day)"
msgstr ""
"Cycles météorologiques: Jour → Neige → Fog → Nuit → Aube (~3,5 min par jour)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Western duel — two gunslingers face off across a cactus obstacle. Dodge bullets you can see coming and shoot your opponent. First to 10 points wins the round, best of 3 rounds. Four distinct game modes offer different obstacles and bullet mechanics."
msgstr ""
"Duel occidental — deux canons se dressent à travers un obstacle de cactus. "
"Dodge balles vous pouvez voir venir et tirer sur votre adversaire. Première "
"à 10 points gagne le tour, meilleur de 3 tours. Quatre modes de jeu "
"distincts offrent différents obstacles et la mécanique des balles."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_debris_field.html.heex:38
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_gravity_well.html.heex:38
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_nml.html.heex:21
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_ricochet.html.heex:25
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_stagecoach.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What's Different"
msgstr "Ce qui est différent"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_skiing_escape.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When the avalanche engulfs a skier, the other wins"
msgstr "Quand l'avalanche engloutit un skieur, l'autre gagne"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "White block"
msgstr "Bloc blanc"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You must time your jumps to land on moving blocks"
msgstr "Vous devez faire vos sauts pour atterrir sur des blocs mobiles"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your block"
msgstr "Votre quartier"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey.html.heex:84
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your goalie moves automatically, tracking the puck vertically"
msgstr ""
"Votre gardien se déplace automatiquement, traçant la rondelle verticalement"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis_sudden.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Zero margin for error"
msgstr "Marge zéro pour erreur"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey.html.heex:93
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "of 2 minutes each (6 minutes total)"
msgstr "de 2 minutes chacune (6 minutes au total)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey_blitz.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "of 3 minutes (no side switching)"
msgstr "de 3 minutes (pas de changement de côté)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost.html.heex:110
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 1 epic round, 20-piece igloo, all enemies from the start"
msgstr "— 1 tour épique, 20 pièces d'igloo, tous ennemis dès le départ"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey.html.heex:111
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 1 period of 3 minutes, faster puck, 80% tackle success"
msgstr "— 1 période de 3 minutes, rondelle plus rapide, 80% de succès"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey_blitz.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 25% speed increase on all shots"
msgstr "— augmentation de 25 % de la vitesse sur tous les plans"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 3-minute race in permanent darkness with fog bursts"
msgstr ""
"— Course de 3 minutes dans l'obscurité permanente avec éclats de brouillard"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey_showdown.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 60% success rate (same as Classic)"
msgstr "— Taux de réussite de 60 % (même que pour les classiques)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 90-second daylight sprint, no weather, no fuel drain"
msgstr "— sprint de 90 secondes, pas de temps, pas de fuite de carburant"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A moving stagecoach blocks shots with unpredictable timing"
msgstr "— Une diligence mobile bloque les tirs avec un timing imprévisible"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_skiing_escape.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A stun at high speeds means the avalanche catches up instantly. One collision can end your run."
msgstr ""
"— Un étourdissement à grande vitesse signifie que l'avalanche rattrape "
"instantanément. Une collision peut mettre fin à votre course."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— AI cars appear as colored dots at the edge of your vision. React to dot colors to predict their lane."
msgstr ""
"— Les voitures AI apparaissent comme des points colorés au bord de votre "
"vision. Réagissez aux couleurs des points pour prédire leur voie."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_blitz.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_pacifist.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Accelerate"
msgstr "— Accélérer"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:32
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:32
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Activate turbo boost"
msgstr "— Activer le turbopropulseur"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_nml.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Advancing gives you faster bullet travel time but also means less time to dodge. Find your sweet spot."
msgstr ""
"— L'avancement vous donne plus de temps de trajet par balle, mais signifie "
"aussi moins de temps pour éviter. Trouvez votre place."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_blitz.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Aliens descend faster in Blitz. Focus on the lowest rows to buy yourself time."
msgstr ""
"— Les étrangers descendent plus vite à Blitz. Concentrez-vous sur les lignes"
" les plus basses pour gagner du temps."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_pong.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_light_trails.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Alternative controls"
msgstr "— Autres contrôles"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost_blizzard.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— At 0.5°/second, you have about 2 minutes. Don't panic but don't dawdle either."
msgstr ""
"— A 0,5°/second, vous avez environ 2 minutes. Ne paniquez pas, mais n'ayez "
"pas peur non plus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_blitz.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— At combo 4+, armored drops appear. These take 2 hits and can clog your opponent's screen."
msgstr ""
"— Au combo 4+, des gouttes blindées apparaissent. Ceux-ci prennent 2 coups "
"et peuvent bloquer l'écran de votre adversaire."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost.html.heex:98
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Bonus collectible between rows (200 points)"
msgstr "— Bonus collectable entre lignes (200 points)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:29
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:29
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Brake"
msgstr "— Frein"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_pacifist.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Bridges give the highest point rewards. Never miss a bridge kill."
msgstr ""
"— Les ponts donnent les récompenses les plus élevées. Ne manquez jamais de "
"tuer un pont."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_ricochet.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Bullets always bounce at matching angles. Position yourself so the ricochet lands where your opponent tends to stand."
msgstr ""
"— Les balles rebondissent toujours à des angles assortis. Positionnez-vous "
"donc les terres ricochet où votre adversaire tend à se tenir."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw.html.heex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Bullets fire at 30-degree angles and bounce once off ceiling/floor"
msgstr ""
"— Les balles s'allument à 30 degrés et rebondissent une fois hors "
"plafond/floor"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_warlords.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Catch fireball on shield contact"
msgstr "— Capturez la boule de feu sur le contact du bouclier"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:11
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:11
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Change lane left"
msgstr "— Changer de voie à gauche"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_night.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Change lane right"
msgstr "— Changer de voie droite"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis.html.heex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Classic: full set with tiebreak at 6-6"
msgstr "— Classique: ensemble complet avec rupture d'attache à 6-6"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_coop.html.heex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Clearing aliens from the sides slows horizontal movement for the entire wave."
msgstr ""
"— L'évacuation des aliens des côtés ralentit le mouvement horizontal pour "
"toute la vague."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_skiing_clean.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Courses repeat. In best-of-3, the third round favors the player who learned the layout."
msgstr ""
"— Les cours se répètent. Dans best-of-3, le troisième tour favorise le "
"joueur qui a appris la mise en page."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid.html.heex:20
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_blitz.html.heex:20
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_pacifist.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Decelerate"
msgstr "— Décélérer"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_blitz.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Decelerate in narrow sections. One wrong move at high speed means instant death on the banks."
msgstr ""
"— Décélérer en sections étroites. Un mauvais mouvement à grande vitesse "
"signifie la mort instantanée sur les rives."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_skiing.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Dense ice patches, fast avalanche, narrow gates"
msgstr "— Plaques de glace denses, avalanche rapide, portes étroites"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_enduro_sprint.html.heex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Don't waste time recovering from crashes. Stay focused from second one."
msgstr ""
"Ne perdez pas de temps à vous remettre des accidents. Restez concentré à "
"partir du deuxième."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid.html.heex:29
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_raid_blitz.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Drop mine"
msgstr "— Lâchez le mien"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_skiing_clean.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Each gate saves 2 seconds. Over a full run, gates make the difference between winning and losing."
msgstr ""
"— Chaque porte économise 2 secondes. Sur une course complète, les portes "
"font la différence entre gagner et perdre."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_coop.html.heex:47
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Each player takes a side. Overlapping coverage wastes shots and leaves gaps."
msgstr ""
"— Chaque joueur prend parti. La couverture de recouvrement gaspille les tirs"
" et laisse des lacunes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis.html.heex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Each point wins a game, first to 6"
msgstr "— Chaque point gagne un match, d'abord à 6"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_invaders_coop.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Earlier waves are easier. Play conservatively to have lives for waves 8-10."
msgstr ""
"— Les vagues antérieures sont plus faciles. Jouez prudemment pour avoir des "
"vies pour les vagues 8-10."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost_peaceful.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Enemies still escalate. In later rounds, focus on survival over speed."
msgstr ""
"— Les ennemis s'aggravent encore. Dans les tours suivants, concentrez-vous "
"sur la survie au-dessus de la vitesse."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_frost_peaceful.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Even though stealing is off, being on the same row as your opponent means fewer blocks for you."
msgstr ""
"— Même si le vol est éteint, être sur la même ligne que votre adversaire "
"signifie moins de blocs pour vous."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis_quick.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Even when behind in a game, fighting to deuce gives you a chance. Never give up a game easily."
msgstr ""
"— Même quand on est derrière un jeu, se battre pour deux vous donne une "
"chance. Ne jamais abandonner un jeu facilement."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_tennis_sudden.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Every single rally decides a game. Stay focused for every point."
msgstr "— Chaque rallye décide d'un jeu. Restez concentré pour chaque point."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_hockey_showdown.html.heex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Fast pucks that hit the corners of the goal are nearly impossible to save."
msgstr ""
"— Les rondelles rapides qui ont atteint les coins du but sont presque "
"impossibles à sauver."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_nml.html.heex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_hex_outlaw_ricochet.html.heex:19
